>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYSTATE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 CURRENT-STATE PIC X(24).
01 RECON-STATUS PIC X(16).
01 CLOSE-DECISION PIC X(24).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO CURRENT-STATE RECON-STATUS CLOSE-DECISION
    END-UNSTRING
    IF RECON-STATUS = "BALANCED"
        DISPLAY "COMPLETED"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "HELD"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
